exports[`CommandTeamOverview > explains experts without mixing other modes' policies 1`] = `"<section class="catalog-source-bar team-mode-summary" aria-label="团队协作说明" data-team-mode="experts"><div class="team-overview-copy"><div class="team-overview-eyebrow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg><span>专家团只由团长对外回复</span></div><h1>一个入口，汇集多位专家</h1><p>由团长拆解问题、协调后台专家，再将不同视角整合为一份结论。</p></div><div class="team-overview-meta"><span class="team-mode-summary-detail">4 个专家团</span><span class="catalog-context-note">团队能力来自左侧智能体页</span></div></section>"`;

